<title>JAPAN: HORSE RACING-FULL ORDER OF FINISH IN JAPAN CUP.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-FULL ORDER OF FINISH IN JAPAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the order of finish in</p>
<p>Sunday's Japan Cup horse race:</p>
<p>1. Singspiel (Britain)</p>
<p>2. Fabulous La Fouine (Japan)</p>
<p>3. dead-heat Strategic Choice (Britain)</p>
<p>	 Helissio (France)</p>
<p>5. Awad (U.S.)</p>
<p>6. Taiki Fortune (Japan)</p>
<p>7. Hishi Natalie (Japan)</p>
<p>8. Pentire (Britain)</p>
<p>9. Flag Down (U.S.)</p>
<p>10. Dance Partner (Japan)</p>
<p>11. Go Go Z (Japan)</p>
<p>12. Yu Sensho (Japan)</p>
<p>13. Bubble Gum Fellow (Japan)</p>
<p>14. Kanetsu Cross (Japan)</p>
<p>15. Sakura Keizan O (Japan)</p>
<p>Scratched - Saintly (Australia)</p>
</text>
